000EA0r 2  0A               ASL A ; * 4
000EA1r 2  18               CLC
000EA2r 2  69 24            ADC #$24
000EA4r 2  8D rr rr         STA colHig
000EA7r 2               
000EA7r 2  AD rr rr         LDA columnNumber
000EAAr 2  0A               ASL A
000EABr 2  0A               ASL A
000EACr 2  0A               ASL A
000EADr 2  0A               ASL A
000EAEr 2  0A               ASL A
